---
layout: base.njk
title: 逍遥学中文
---

<section class="feed" aria-label="Learning notes">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <article class="post-card">
      <header class="post-heading">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDate }}">{{ post.date | dateCn }}</time>
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
      </header>

      {% if post.data.image %}
        <figure class="post-image">
          <img src="{{ post.data.image | url }}" alt="{{ post.data.imageAlt or post.data.title }}">
        </figure>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="post-content">
        {{ post.templateContent | safe }}
      </div>

      {% set tags = post.data.tags | asArray %}
      {% if tags.length %}
        <ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags">
          {% for tag in tags %}
            <li>{{ tag }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      {% endif %}
    </article>
  {% else %}
    <article class="post-card">
      <header class="post-heading">
        <h2>还没有文章</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="post-content">
        <p>第一篇文章很快就会在这里出现。</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

